      <span style="background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12); color: #c084fc; border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35); padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px;">STATUTORY CLEARANCE</span>
      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory Interstate e-Way Bills, Regulatory Clearances &amp; 100% Marine Insurance for packers and movers kolkata to gurgaon</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When orchestrating a long-distance <strong>gurgaon to kolkata relocation</strong>, understanding the statutory transit paperwork is as critical as the physical packing. The journey between these two major metropolitan hubs requires strict adherence to Indian commercial transport laws to ensure a seamless and legally compliant move.</p>
<p>Whether you are coordinating <strong>house shifting charges from gurgaon to kolkata</strong> or managing the reverse route, the documentation trail must be airtight.</p>

<p>The foundation of your legal compliance is the <strong>GST e-Way Bill</strong>. For any consignment valued above specific thresholds, this digital document is mandatory. It must be generated before the vehicle departs, detailing the sender, receiver, and goods.</p>
<p>Failure to present a valid e-Way Bill at check posts can result in the seizure of your goods and hefty penalties, disrupting your entire timeline. This is a non-negotiable requirement for any professional <strong>movers and packers gurgaon to kolkata</strong> service provider who claims to operate within legal boundaries.</p>

<p>Beyond the e-Way Bill, you must receive an <strong>IBA-approved Lorry Receipt (LR/Bilty)</strong>. This document serves as the primary contract of carriage. It outlines the terms of transport, liability limits, and the specific route.</p>
<p>When selecting <strong>domestic packers and movers in kolkata</strong> or their counterparts in the capital, ensure the LR number matches your e-Way Bill. Reputable firms, such as <strong>pooja cargo packers and movers kolkata</strong>, treat this document with the same seriousness as the goods themselves. It is your legal proof of ownership and transit status.</p>

<p>While paperwork protects you legally, financial protection requires <strong>comprehensive 100% declared-value IRDAI marine transit insurance</strong>. Standard carrier liability often caps claims significantly below the actual value of your household goods.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">A specific transit insurance policy covers risks such as <strong>accidental collision</strong>, fire, theft, and even losses due to <strong>unforeseen delays</strong> that might compromise perishable items or urgent essentials.</p>
