    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">All powered equipment—computers, printers, HVAC units, and kitchen appliances—are plugged in and subjected to a quick functionality test. Voltage, current, and operational parameters are measured against manufacturer specifications. Any anomalies trigger a maintenance ticket and are not accepted until cleared.</p>
